cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "MitoFuse: animal mitochondrial genome annotation that combines MitoZ, MITOS2 and other tools"
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite this GitHub repository AND the tools it runs
  (see "references" below and the README section "Citation"). No other conditions apply:
  the code of this repository is dedicated to the public domain (CC0 1.0).
